  "remarks": "Associated with the Islamic Jihad Union (IJU), also known as the Islamic Jihad Group (QDe.119).Deported from Germany to Türkiye in February 2019. Ongoing judicial process as of November 2023. Photo available for inclusion \nin the INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 2368 (2017) was concluded on 4 Dec. 2019. INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice web link: https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals. In prison since Sep. 2007.",
